rows 5
cols 4
why Resetting DECOM returns addressing to the whole screen while leaving the
why margins alone. The same CUP that landed inside the region while origin mode
why was set must now land at the top of the SCREEN, and row 5 must reach the
why last row rather than being clamped to the region. Resetting also homes the
why cursor, so the write starts from row 1 without a further CUP.
stream \e[2;4r
stream \e[?6h
stream \e[1;1Hin
stream \e[?6l
stream \e[1;1Htop
stream \e[5;1Hend
cursor 4 3
line top
line in
line
line
line end
